<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up, Iruka!</font>

109
00:05:43,940 --> 00:05:47,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you have any idea how much
I've been waiting for this moment?</font>

110
00:05:48,110 --> 00:05:51,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been waiting for this day
