111
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For this time of revenge.</font>

112
00:05:55,450 --> 00:05:56,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will use this power of mine</font>

113
00:05:56,660 --> 00:05:59,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and take my own good time
to crush each of you, one at a time.</font>

114
00:05:59,710 --> 00:06:03,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, stand up, Iruka.
I'll start by killing this guy.</font>

115
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:06,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki...!</font>

116
00:06:07,090 --> 00:06:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There you go.
That's good!</font>

117
