<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on!</font>

118
00:06:14,930 --> 00:06:16,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are pathetic.</font>

119
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:19,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a world of difference
between us, isn't there?</font>

120
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:24,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've gotten my hands on
this extreme body</font>

121
00:06:24,900 --> 00:06:27,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it is your fate
to die wretchedly.</font>

122
00:06:27,950 --> 00:06:30,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean,
"extreme body"?</font>

123
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:33,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When your power depends
on potions,</font>

124
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:35,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's not true power!</font>

125
00:06:35,580 --> 00:06:38,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That sounds just like
the half-baked guy you are...</font>

126
00:06:39,540 --> 00:06:41,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case, go ahead
and try winning...</font>

127
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:44,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Using that real power
you're talking about!</font>

128
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:49,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm different from you.
You're gonna live out your life...</font>

129
00:06:49,300 --> 00:06:51,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as some lowly teacher who never thinks
about getting ahead in life,</font>

130
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:54,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who only gets used by the village
in whatever way they see fit.</font>

131
00:06:55,930 --> 00:06:58,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How do you like... this power...
and the way I carry myself?!</font>

132
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you trained
a hundred years,</font>

133
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:03,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'll never be able
to earn it!</font>

134
00:07:08,610 --> 00:07:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not gonna stop here!</font>

135
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:13,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm still gonna get much
much stronger...</font>

136
00:07:13,740 --> 00:07:16,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll get Orochimaru to share
his Hidden Jutsu with me.</font>

137
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:21,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you really think that will happen?</font>

138
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:25,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm getting tired of you
playing the martyr.</font>

139
00:07:26,340 --> 00:07:28,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think it's about time
to end this.</font>

140
00:07:29,380 --> 00:07:31,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't this nostalgic...?</font>

141
00:07:31,430 --> 00:07:34,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time, I'll get you for sure.</font>

142
00:07:34,970 --> 00:07:36,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So prepare yourself.</font>

143
00:07:52,150 --> 00:07:53,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

144
00:07:58,240 --> 00:08:02,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk! Don't you dare lay
your hands on Iruka-sensei!</font>

145
00:08:09,050 --> 00:08:10,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is really something!</font>

146
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:14,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Every little thing is exactly the same
as it was that other time.</font>

147
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:20,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I've changed.</font>

148
00:08:21,350 --> 00:08:23,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason for my defeat
that time...</font>

149
00:08:23,980 --> 00:08:28,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was that I let my guard down
to the demon fox that you are.</font>

150
00:08:40,660 --> 00:08:42,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What's that?!</font>

151
00:08:43,210 --> 00:08:45,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let my guard down again.</font>

152
00:08:46,250 --> 00:08:48,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll call upon all my strength
to beat you down!</font>

153
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:52,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bring it on!</font>

154
00:08:59,180 --> 00:09:00,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry... both of you...</font>

155
00:09:06,060 --> 00:09:07,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji!</font>

156
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:17,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... If only I had a little more
information about those guys...</font>

157
00:09:20,580 --> 00:09:24,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother...
My body feels lighter.</font>

158
00:09:24,620 --> 00:09:28,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, Raijin, it feels lighter,
doesn't it?</font>

159
00:09:28,630 --> 00:09:30,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, time for clobbering...</font>

160
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:33,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Clobbering!</font>

161
00:09:37,550 --> 00:09:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There they come.</font>

162
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:41,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

163
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:50,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

164
00:09:50,610 --> 00:09:52,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell is this?!</font>

165
00:09:52,690 --> 00:09:54,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-My body...</font>

166
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:56,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doesn't move...!</font>

167
00:09:57,030 --> 00:09:59,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Genjutsu Paralysis?</font>

168
00:10:00,870 --> 00:10:02,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like I made it in time.</font>

169
00:10:04,580 --> 00:10:08,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good work!
Shikamaru, Ino, Choji!</font>

170
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:10,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave the rest to me!</font>

171
00:10:10,750 --> 00:10:12,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The F-Fifth Hokage!</font>

172
00:10:13,380 --> 00:10:16,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...
Hokage-sama... in person?!</font>

173
00:10:17,220 --> 00:10:18,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama.</font>

174
00:10:22,810 --> 00:10:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry I found out
about this so late.</font>

175
00:10:26,060 --> 00:10:27,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I wouldn't have imagined</font>

176
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:30,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that these guys were
hanging out with Mizuki...</font>

177
00:10:30,980 --> 00:10:32,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fifth Hokage!</font>

178
00:10:32,610 --> 00:10:34,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are saved...!</font>

179
00:10:38,530 --> 00:10:41,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... uh... Elder Brother...</font>

180
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... Oh...</font>

181
00:10:42,910 --> 00:10:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, we run into each other
in unusual places, don't we,</font>

182
00:10:46,450 --> 00:10:48,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fujin and Raijin?</font>

183
00:10:51,210 --> 00:10:54,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-Tsunade...</font>

184
00:10:54,340 --> 00:10:57,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me ask what
you're doing here.</font>

185
00:11:06,770 --> 00:11:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Powerful.</font>

186
00:11:08,140 --> 00:11:10,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More like, scary.</font>

187
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:14,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, is there something
you want to say?</font>

188
00:11:14,770 --> 00:11:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry. I'm sorry.</font>

189
00:11:16,820 --> 00:11:19,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please forgive me.
We'll never do it again!</font>

190
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:24,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you guys went with Mizuki
because he told you that</font>

191
00:11:24,740 --> 00:11:28,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'd be able to eat something good
at Orochimaru's place?</font>

192
00:11:28,790 --> 00:11:31,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I'm, I'm sorry.
— I'm, I'm sorry.</font>

193
00:11:31,290 --> 00:11:34,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way we could stand up to guys on the
same level as the Three Legendary Ninja.</font>

194
00:11:34,750 --> 00:11:36,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I wonder what happened
between them the past...</font>

195
00:11:37,050 --> 00:11:38,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to make those two that scared.</font>

196
00:11:38,420 --> 00:11:41,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No thanks. I don't even want
to imagine what it might be.</font>

197
00:11:41,380 --> 00:11:44,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gimme a break.
Falling for such an obvious bait!</font>

198
00:11:46,010 --> 00:11:49,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki has apparently gone
into those mountains up ahead.</font>

199
00:11:50,060 --> 00:11:51,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto and Iruka are probably
with him...</font>

200
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:55,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys come along
after recuperating a little.</font>

201
00:11:55,310 --> 00:11:57,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... wait a minute.</font>

202
00:11:58,230 --> 00:11:59,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are we going to do
with these two guys?</font>

203
00:12:00,570 --> 00:12:02,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? You don't need
to worry about that...</font>

204
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:05,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly, I can't let them
cause any more trouble.</font>

205
00:12:06,830 --> 00:12:09,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've decided to make these guys
go home on their own.</font>

206
00:12:10,620 --> 00:12:14,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Fujin, Raijin. I assume
you understand this already,</font>

207
00:12:14,330 --> 00:12:16,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but if you're even one minute late
you're not getting any dinner.</font>

208
00:12:17,250 --> 00:12:18,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes, ma'am!
— Yes, ma'am!</font>

209
00:12:19,420 --> 00:12:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't be doing this, Raijin.</font>

210
00:12:22,380 --> 00:12:24,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's hurry back to the institution.</font>

211
00:12:24,590 --> 00:12:26,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother, dinner, right?!</font>

212
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:27,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dinner!</font>

213
00:12:29,310 --> 00:12:32,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Dinner, dinner, dinner, dinner...
— Dinner, dinner, dinner, dinner...</font>

214
00:12:32,730 --> 00:12:35,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Amazing...
what incredible speed.</font>

215
00:12:35,980 --> 00:12:39,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's very important for
a person to eat, after all.</font>

216
00:12:39,530 --> 00:12:41,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's just you.</font>

217
00:12:51,410 --> 00:12:55,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! His power is
even greater than earlier!</font>

218
00:13:00,750 --> 00:13:03,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I can't let him
take me down.</font>

219
00:13:03,380 --> 00:13:06,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy may have a lead
to Sasuke's whereabouts.</font>

220
00:13:07,050 --> 00:13:08,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

221
00:13:08,760 --> 00:13:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka, are you all right?</font>

222
00:13:10,390 --> 00:13:11,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

223
00:13:11,470 --> 00:13:13,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you notice?</font>

224
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:14,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

225
00:13:14,940 --> 00:13:17,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although that jerk's power
has increased multifold,</font>

226
00:13:17,770 --> 00:13:21,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the sharpness of his movements
is diminishing.</font>

227
00:13:21,110 --> 00:13:22,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

228
00:13:22,530 --> 00:13:25,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did he transfer the Chakra
he was using for speed, to power?</font>

229
00:13:25,490 --> 00:13:27,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't really know that, but...</font>

230
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:32,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's quite a heavy burden
for Naruto to bear alone.</font>

231
00:13:32,700 --> 00:13:34,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if that guy's speed
has diminished,</font>

232
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:36,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there might be a chance to win.</font>

233
00:13:37,290 --> 00:13:40,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right... You hang in there
a little bit more, Naruto!</font>

234
00:13:41,750 --> 00:13:43,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about this,
you little brat?</font>

235
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:47,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you like the power of this body
that Orochimaru-sama gave me!</font>

236
00:13:49,260 --> 00:13:51,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll tear you apart.</font>

237
00:13:53,770 --> 00:13:56,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where the hell is he...?</font>

238
00:13:57,390 --> 00:14:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Orochimaru...
Where is he?</font>

239
00:14:01,110 --> 00:14:04,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why would I tell a little brat
like you that kind of thing?</font>

240
00:14:04,400 --> 00:14:07,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He wasn't in
the Village Hidden in the Sound.</font>

241
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:10,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village Hidden in the Sound?
Did you go there?!</font>

242
00:14:11,030 --> 00:14:13,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The compound was
already totally empty...</font>

243
00:14:14,330 --> 00:14:17,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neither Sasuke nor Orochimaru
was there anymore.</font>

244
00:14:19,380 --> 00:14:22,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really gave that one
a lot of thought for a guy like you, huh...</font>

245
00:14:22,590 --> 00:14:26,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know where you heard that
about the Village Hidden in the Sound...</font>

246
00:14:26,340 --> 00:14:29,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but if you're trying to fluster me
by talking rubbish like that,</font>

247
00:14:29,470 --> 00:14:31,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's not gonna happen.</font>

248
00:14:32,510 --> 00:14:35,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give up 'cause you're going
to the next world.</font>

249
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:41,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen carefully. Don't you dare talk
that kind of trash again!</font>

250
00:14:50,530 --> 00:14:52,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, this way.</font>

251
00:14:52,700 --> 00:14:53,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei...</font>

252
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:06,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just try to catch me!</font>

253
00:15:06,550 --> 00:15:09,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk... don't even think
I'm gonna let you get away!</font>

254
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:17,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now! Jump up, Naruto!</font>

255
00:15:17,850 --> 00:15:19,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!!</font>

256
00:15:23,270 --> 00:15:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... this is...!</font>

257
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:28,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seal and Capture Perimeter!</font>

258
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:31,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Capture and Arrest Jutsu!</font>

259
00:15:36,540 --> 00:15:38,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

260
00:15:38,450 --> 00:15:40,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, that Jutsu is...</font>

261
00:15:53,220 --> 00:15:57,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's the Fourth Hokage's
Jutsu... Rasengan...</font>

262
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:02,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you all right, Iruka-sensei?</font>

263
00:16:03,350 --> 00:16:06,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, that was spectacular.
Good work!</font>

264
00:16:06,770 --> 00:16:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen Sensei...</font>

265
00:16:07,900 --> 00:16:10,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like this guy didn't know
about the Village Hidden in the Sound.</font>

266
00:16:10,900 --> 00:16:12,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I was thinking that he's no longer...
with Orochimaru...</font>

267
00:16:12,910 --> 00:16:15,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't talk trash...</font>

268
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:19,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki...</font>

269
00:16:19,910 --> 00:16:21,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You gotta be kidding...</font>

270
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:25,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is an extreme body that
I received from Orochimaru-sama...</font>

271
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will go to the Village of Hidden Sound
and become even more...</font>

272
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:31,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei, what's this?!</font>

273
00:16:32,260 --> 00:16:34,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just as I thought, after all.</font>

274
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade...</font>

275
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:37,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama.</font>

276
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:41,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His cells have started dying.</font>

277
00:16:41,890 --> 00:16:44,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk...
What have you done to me?!</font>

278
00:16:44,770 --> 00:16:46,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not Naruto's fault.</font>

279
00:16:46,810 --> 00:16:48,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's caused from the substances
you took!</font>

280
00:16:49,150 --> 00:16:51,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? That's impossible!</font>

281
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:53,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're getting a taste of
your own medicine.</font>

282
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:57,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That substance wasn't
fully developed yet.</font>

283
00:17:01,410 --> 00:17:03,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The last casualty has been recovered.</font>

284
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:08,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears that Shizune was injured,
but there's no threat to her life.</font>

285
00:17:09,250 --> 00:17:11,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. Thanks for your work.</font>

286
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:15,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a relief... Shizune is safe.</font>

287
00:17:16,800 --> 00:17:21,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru probably developed
that substance by chance</font>

288
00:17:21,310 --> 00:17:23,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">while he was trying to develop
a Forbidden Jutsu.</font>

289
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:26,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is certain is that</font>

290
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:28,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that substance assimilates
the DNA of animals</font>

291
00:17:28,520 --> 00:17:30,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and when it combines
with the human body</font>

292
00:17:30,270 --> 00:17:32,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that serves to draw out its power
in an explosive manner.</font>

293
00:17:34,110 --> 00:17:36,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But its effect is only short term.</font>

294
00:17:37,910 --> 00:17:41,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And in exchange,
it puts a strain on the cells</font>

295
00:17:41,580 --> 00:17:44,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that far exceeds the limits
of the human body.</font>

296
00:17:45,330 --> 00:17:47,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It certainly isn't something
that's one could actually use.</font>

297
00:17:49,710 --> 00:17:52,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why did Mizuki...?</font>

298
00:17:52,590 --> 00:17:54,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know the details</font>

299
00:17:54,420 --> 00:17:56,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it must be that Mizuki
and Orochimaru</font>

300
00:17:56,630 --> 00:17:59,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">had a point of contact in the past...</font>

301
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:00,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

302
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:02,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That tie has already been severed.</font>

303
00:18:02,470 --> 00:18:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, unfortunately Orochimaru
just used him as a plaything.</font>

304
00:18:07,730 --> 00:18:11,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Giving him an unusable drug...
he's probably laughing his butt off.</font>

305
00:18:13,030 --> 00:18:15,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Mizuki is one lucky guy...</font>

306
00:18:15,990 --> 00:18:19,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An ordinary Shinobi would
have lost his life.</font>

307
00:18:20,660 --> 00:18:23,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although he won't be able to live
his life as a Shinobi any more.</font>

308
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unfortunate, isn't it, Naruto?</font>

309
00:18:28,290 --> 00:18:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I kind of had that feeling anyway...</font>

310
00:18:30,830 --> 00:18:31,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

311
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:34,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I won't give up!</font>

312
00:18:34,420 --> 00:18:37,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will continue to do my best to search
for clues to Sasuke's whereabouts.</font>

313
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:41,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsubaki...</font>

314
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:44,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it, Iruka!</font>

315
00:18:45,220 --> 00:18:46,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't talk!</font>

316
00:18:46,430 --> 00:18:50,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next time I'll take you and that
little squirt down without fail.</font>

317
00:18:51,100 --> 00:18:52,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way you
could do that.</font>

318
00:18:53,020 --> 00:18:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While you were pursuing
your futile dream,</font>

319
00:18:55,940 --> 00:18:58,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto's been actively honing
his skills.</font>

320
00:18:59,320 --> 00:19:01,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't possibly catch up
with him any longer.</font>

321
00:19:03,410 --> 00:19:06,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki can never go back
to being a Shinobi again...</font>

322
00:19:06,910 --> 00:19:07,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsubaki...</font>

323
00:19:08,620 --> 00:19:10,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm thinking of starting over
again too...</font>

324
00:19:12,210 --> 00:19:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But first I must atone for
all the trouble I caused the village...</font>

325
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a beautiful sunset.</font>

326
00:19:23,390 --> 00:19:24,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's return to the village.</font>

327
00:19:25,970 --> 00:19:27,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dried and Canned Goods</font>

328
00:19:28,140 --> 00:19:29,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fish Market</font>

329
00:19:36,610 --> 00:19:38,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't...</font>

330
00:19:39,150 --> 00:19:40,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">ever give up either!</font>

331
00:19:47,910 --> 00:19:49,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it!</font>

332
00:19:54,420 --> 00:19:58,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, since everybody
worked so hard today,</font>

333
00:19:58,300 --> 00:20:01,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to do something special
and treat you all to a meal at Ichiraku.</font>

334
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:05,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yippee! You're a real man,
Iruka-sensei!</font>

335
00:20:05,550 --> 00:20:07,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want a block of barbecued pork!</font>

336
00:20:07,810 --> 00:20:10,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want large portions of
