337
00:20:10,100 --> 00:20:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">miso, soy sauce and butter!</font>

338
00:20:12,020 --> 00:20:13,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Iruka, before you do that,</font>

339
00:20:13,650 --> 00:20:16,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you and Naruto need to go
to Leaf Village Hospital.</font>

340
00:20:16,360 --> 00:20:18,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... I told you I'm okay.</font>

341
00:20:19,070 --> 00:20:20,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't argue with me.</font>

342
00:20:20,860 --> 00:20:22,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

343
00:20:24,950 --> 00:20:27,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I cleared the first stage!</font>

344
00:20:31,910 --> 00:20:34,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's just started her
ascetic training...</font>

345
00:20:36,210 --> 00:20:39,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could she be an exceptional talent
on par with Shizune...?</font>

346
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:43,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Sakura...!</font>

347
00:20:46,510 --> 00:20:49,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time you saved me...</font>

348
00:20:51,730 --> 00:20:56,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've really become stronger,
