<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">I'll take this sinking world, all its evil bastards, and kick their butts, yeah</font></b></font></font></font>

371
00:22:40,080 --> 00:22:41,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I can't stand it any longer!</font>

372
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:45,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">No matter how long I wait, there's no clue
