374
00:22:50,050 --> 00:22:52,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">At this rate, we'll never find Sasuke!</font>

375
00:22:53,430 --> 00:22:55,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Isn't there anything?</font>

